+## Decisions
+
+One line each; the evidence and history behind each row are in `LOG.md`.
+
+| Area | Decision |
+|------|----------|
+| Agent model | One steerable agent with soft modes; one opt-in read-only scout as a child `pi` behind `bin/scout`. No standing subagents. |
+| Model config | `settings.json` and `bin/scout` (`MODEL=`) are authoritative; this file does not track models. No main-session fallback: switch with `/model`. |
+| Thinking | Default `medium`; `Shift+Tab` cycles; the editor border shows the level. |
+| Compaction | Pi defaults with `keepRecentTokens` 16k, plus `compact-cap.ts`: a flat 210k cap that warns mid-run ("/handoff and start fresh") and compacts only between runs. `/compact-cap [on|off|<n>k]`. |
+| Modes | Prompt templates, no tool gating: `/plan`, `/review`, `/memory`, `/challenge`, `/grill`, `/diagnose`, `/handoff`. |
+| Questions | `pi-ask-user` for `ask_user`; `ask-user-args.ts` repairs OpenAI models' padded batches (pi-ask-user#88). |
+| RTK | `pi-rtk-optimizer` compacts noisy tool output; rewrite notices off; no-op where the `rtk` binary is absent. |
+| Context pruning | Removed 2026-07-26: it went silently inert when its summarizer failed. |
+| Compaction UX | `prime-reminder.ts`: every compaction arms a one-shot pointer back to the rules on the next turn. Nothing auto-resumes. |
+| Web access | `pi-web-access` (`web_search`, `fetch_content`), deferred until `web_enable`, 15k inline cap; `docs.ts` gives one `docs(library, query)` tool on Context7's HTTP API. |
+| Skills | Five skills from `~/.agents/skills`, shared with Claude Code: `decisions`, `testing-patterns`, `git-patterns`, `pdf-images`, `map`. Every description is resident each turn; keep the list short. |
+| Persona | `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.work.md` and `CLAUDE.md` are generated from `agents-md/` by `build-agents.sh`; edit fragments only. Judgment, done-when and scope first; the ladder last. |
+| Themes | Three vendored theme packs in `themes/`, default `bearded-hc-midnightvoid`. |
+| Scout | `bin/scout` spawns a minimal read-only child `pi` (low thinking, 300 s, at most two live, nesting refused) and returns a 3-4 KB digest. See Scout. |
+| MLX | `mlx-local.ts` registers OMLX at `localhost:11434/v1` only when the server and `$OMLX_API_KEY` are present. |
+| Bedrock | Pi's built-in `amazon-bedrock` provider; add model ids to `enabledModels` when adopting. Keep Bedrock sessions short (5-min cache TTL, 1M windows). |
+| UI | `pi-minimalist` (0.3.1) rows, `split-diff.ts` (pi-tidy 0.4.12 renderer), and patched copies `polish-chrome.ts`, `context-bar.ts`, `heads-up.ts`, `background.ts`; `kitty-links.ts` opens clicked files in nvim. |
+| Jobs | `background.ts`: `bg_run`/`bg_status`/`bg_kill`, bash capped at 120 s default / 600 s max, idle foreground bash killed after 90 s, zero-token job watchdog (`lib/watchdog.ts`). Jobs die with the session. |
+| Stream stalls | `stream-watchdog.ts` aborts a silent stream after 5 min (10 at xhigh/max) and resumes once; `bin/scout` kills a child whose session file goes stale (600 s, 900 s at xhigh). |
+| Bedrock thinking | `bedrock-reasoning.ts` asks Bedrock GPT for reasoning summaries and drops replayed `reasoningText` it rejects. |
+| Tracking | Config lives in `~/Dev/dotfiles/config/pi/`, symlinked into `~/.pi/agent/`; pi itself is the managed install under `~/.pi/agent/install/releases/`. |
+| Placement | Each job sits in the tool that owns it (hook, CLI, script); a harness extension only when the job lives inside the harness. |
+| Scout git guard | `bin/guard/git` is first on PATH in every scout child and refuses history, stash, remote, tree-switching, commit and add on the scout's own repo. A tripwire, not a sandbox. |
+| Slice done check | `bin/slice-check.ts` judges a `/plan` card: done-when commands pass, changes stay inside the card's files, no test lost cases or gained skip/only. `--staged` runs only the test check. |
+| Worktrees | Branches first; worktrees through worktrunk (`wt`) only when two trees must be live. `worktree-setup` installs deps when a lockfile differs from main's and syncs env files from main. |
 
